  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Drawing graphs of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d351bccc-df9a-4e13-919a-dba19fddab62.png\" style=\"width:2.50694in;height:0.97986in\" /></p><p>For points of intersection,</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Required area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
